  "id": "bkr/dmi",
  "title": "Nordic Regional NWP Models",
  "description": "A cloud-native Icechunk/Zarr archive of hourly atmospheric analysis and forecast fields for the Nordic region and Arctic, combining output from the Danish HARMONIE model (2 km resolution, covering Greenland and Iceland) with the MetCoOp MEPS model (2.5 km resolution, covering the broader Nordic region).",
